# Archives (historical, not part of active codebase)
# DATA — Runtime artifacts NOT part of source code
# ENTITY DATA — Exclude test/transient artifacts, keep soul/knowledge
# External/Reference Dirs
# LEGACY — Orphaned artifacts that must never return to tracking
# Legacy dev workspace (odysseus)
# Orphan/Test entity dirs
