# ── Database Files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Docker ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Downloaded Models (large binaries, not source) ────────────────────
# ── Environment & Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Eradicated Directories (NEVER re-create, NEVER re-track) ────────
# ── Experiment Labs (local research, not ready for distribution) ──
# Per M28 (proposed): experiments are local-only research labs.
# Symlinks to external storage (e.g., omega_library) are local artifacts.
data/experiments/

# ── External Projects (separate repos, not part of Omega Engine) ──
