# ── Research & Analysis (transient, regenerated per session) ────────
# ── Research/Test Artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Runtime Data (generated at runtime, not source) ────────────────
# ── Session & Coordination (runtime, regenerated per session) ───────
# ── Session Artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Sovereign Key Vault (encrypted API key storage) ─────────────────
# ── Temp & Ad-Hoc Files ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Test & Cache ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Third-Party Reference Repos (never commit) ───────────────────────
# ── Virtual Environments ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Web Research Caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────
